1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Remember rewinding a cassette with a pencil?

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,590
So, how many turns does it really take?

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,330
A C ninety tape plays forty-five minutes per side.

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,610
At one and seven-eighths inches a second, that's about four hundred twenty feet of tape.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,450
One pencil turn winds about four and a third inches.

6
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,560
Four hundred twenty feet, divided by four and a third inches...

7
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:22,840
About eleven hundred seventy turns!

8
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:27,000
At two turns a second, almost ten minutes. For one side.
